  ],
  "role": "watch",
  "scene_ja": "客のFramtonに、Veraが叔母の『悲劇』を切り出す場面。Veraは開け放たれたフランス窓を見やってから話し始める。",
  "why_ja": "不穏な話の切り出し。感情を示す語は本文に無く、地の文は窓を見る動作だけ(過剰演技の監視)。",
  "speaker": "vera",
  "voice": "Zephyr",
  "text": "\"Her great tragedy happened three years ago today.\"",
  "context": {
   "clip_id": "full_story_part1_c7",
   "speaker": "vera",
   "speaker_display": "Vera",
   "voice": "Zephyr",
   "text": "\"Her great tragedy happened three years ago today.\"",
   "part": 1,
   "prev_dialogue": [
    {
     "clip_id": "full_story_part1_c4",
     "speaker": "vera",
     "speaker_display": "Vera",
     "text": "\"Do you know much about her?\""
    },
    {
     "clip_id": "full_story_part1_c5",
     "speaker": "framton",
     "speaker_display": "Framton",
     "text": "\"Almost nothing,\""
    }
   ],
   "next_dialogue": [
    {
     "clip_id": "full_story_part1_c9",
     "speaker": "vera",
     "speaker_display": "Vera",
     "text": "\"Her husband and her two young brothers went out shooting through that window. Their little brown spaniel went with them. They tried to cross a bog, but the ground gave way beneath them. They all disappeared. Their bodies were never found.\""
    }
   ],
   "narration_before": "he admitted. Vera glanced towards the French window, which stood wide open to the lawn.",
