     "speaker": "vera",
     "speaker_display": "Vera",
     "text": "\"Her husband and her two young brothers went out shooting through that window. Their little brown spaniel went with them. They tried to cross a bog, but the ground gave way beneath them. They all disappeared. Their bodies were never found.\""
    },
    {
     "clip_id": "full_story_part1_c10",
     "speaker": "framton",
     "speaker_display": "Framton",
     "text": "\"How terrible,\""
    }
   ],
